<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Waste started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Waste started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette analyst Marc Sulam confirmed he started coverage of United Waste Systems Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month price target of 42.</p>
<p>-- Earnings estimate set at $1.05 per share for 1996, $1.40 for 1997 and $1.70 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- Shares unchanged at 32-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
